{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1521020001:1":{"text":"이, 이렇게 힘든 시기에 이렇게 착한 사람이 있을 줄이야...!","source_cn":"真……真没想到，这么艰难的时候还能遇到好心人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD54B76FD05A6903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521020002:0":{"text":"맞아... 기근과 가뭄이 닥친 이후로 우리 집 물건은 전부 다 식량으로 바꿨거든. 이렇게 따뜻하고 두툼한 옷은 정말 오랜만이야...","source_cn":"是啊……自从饥荒和干旱开始，我家的东西就全都拿去换食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CA19A9A9106D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521020003:0":{"text":"평범한 옷 아니야? 창고에 있는 옷을 아무거나 몇 벌 가져온건데.","source_cn":"这衣服不是很普通吗？我只是从库房里随便拿了几件。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8A0A835AD24E68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521020004:0":{"text":"필요한 사람이 많다면 모두에게 나눠줄 수도...","source_cn":"如果有很多人都需要的话，我应该可以给每个人都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670779E7D09923CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521020005:0":{"text":"...크흠.","source_cn":"……咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B517AEBE0D72A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521020006:0":{"text":"왜 기침이야? 너도 감기 걸렸어?","source_cn":"你干嘛咳嗽？也感冒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885EA8181A02BA1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521020007:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog100>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CDD3EF7C0AB622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521020008:0":{"text":"착한 아이들이네. 고마워.","source_cn":"好孩子们，谢谢你们的好意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1519BF910F3CA739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521020009:0":{"text":"사실... 나랑 우리 남편은 보칼리스를 떠나야하나 고민하고 있었거든.","source_cn":"其实……我和我丈夫瓦罗已经在考虑要不要离开呼临城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F83153F5D479DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521020010:0":{"text":"보칼리스를 떠나? 왜?!","source_cn":"离开呼临城？为什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27F46B64A232E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521020011:1":{"text":"왜냐니. 이유는 뻔하잖니.","source_cn":"这还用问吗？原因都摆在眼前了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9315246E64D3B60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521020012:1":{"text":"가뭄에 기근, 전쟁에 홍수까지... 우린 집도 벌써 팔아 치워서 더는 머물 곳도 없는 상황이야.","source_cn":"先是干旱、饥荒，又是战争、洪水……我们的房子早就变卖了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50CB7ED93DC0620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521020013:0":{"text":"그래도 우리는 운이 좋았지. 집이 떠내려가기 전에 조금이나마 식량으로 바꿀 수 있었으니까.","source_cn":"这还算是幸运的。至少在房子被冲塌之前，我们换来了一点口粮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541CAACF24371A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521020014:0":{"text":"그리고 우리 아이는... 전쟁이 일어나자마자 징집되어서 그 뒤로는 아무런 소식도 들을 수 없게 되었어...","source_cn":"还有我们的亲人……我们的孩子很早就被征召入伍。从那以后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF554AD20FCF418AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521020015:0":{"text":"아마, 벌써 세상을 떠났을지도 몰라...","source_cn":"也许他早已经不在人世了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D5D6AAE4A61445C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521020016:0":{"text":"보칼리스에는 슬픈 기억 밖에 남지 않았어. 조금 더 일찍 떠났어야 했을지도 모르지.","source_cn":"呼临城是个伤心地，我们早就该离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E572D010DEDC48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521020017:0":{"text":"하지만, 하지만... 보칼리스를 떠나서 어디로 가려고?","source_cn":"可是……可是离开呼临城以后，你们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D16B9700842DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521020018:0":{"text":"여기서 가장 가까운 <style=\"highlight\">투타 마을</style>로 가려고. 너희는 어디로 갈 생각이니?","source_cn":"离这里最近的是<style=highlight>图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE068F92C2FE227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521020019:0":{"text":"투타 마을...?","source_cn":"图塔镇……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAA8749A6B2E6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521020020:0":{"text":"선생님 말로는 투타 마을에도 재난이 일어났다고 그랬는데... 그래서 요즘 그쪽 사람들은 보칼리스로 장사하러 오지도 않아.","source_cn":"我听老师说，图塔镇好像也发生了天灾……那里的居民都很久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA028B9E921DCDD9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521020021:0":{"text":"재난은 무슨! 투타 마을은 풍요의 신을 믿는 곳인데, 재난이 일어날 리가 있겠어?","source_cn":"什么天灾！图塔镇那么虔诚地信仰丰饶神，怎么可能会遇到天灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A00DB9FBAE07444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521020022:1":{"text":"오히려 보칼리스의 재난이야 말로 <style=\"highlight\">풍요의 신께서 내리신 벌</style>이지! 제대로 된 영주 대신 웬 어린애를 영주랍시고 그 자리에 앉힌 벌이야!","source_cn":"要我说，呼临城遇到的天灾才是<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5D567238F9F5574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521020023:0":{"text":"뭐... 뭐라고? 지금 영주가 뭐 어때서!","source_cn":"你……你在说什么？领主有什么问题？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB263CFFD8C1662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521020024:0":{"text":"영주는 아마 네 또래쯤 되었을 거란다. 지금 네 나이에 보칼리스만한 큰 곳을 다스릴 수 있을 것 같니?","source_cn":"孩子，领主的年纪应该和你差不多大，你觉得你能管理好这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6BAEB9A9897D721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521020025:0":{"text":"홍수가 일어난 이후로 영주가 주민들을 보살피러 나온 걸 본 적은 있어? 심지어 군대를 보내지도 않고!","source_cn":"洪水发生之后，领主有出面安抚过民众吗？他甚至都不舍得调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x821B0105EAB12C09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521020026:0":{"text":"나, 나는...","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog54>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1521020026":{"text":"나, 나는...","source_cn":"我……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521020027:0":{"text":"보칼리스의 영주는 왜 아이인가요?","source_cn":"为什么呼临城的领主会是一个小孩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D87E81D571DC065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521020028:1":{"text":"모두가 영주를 싫어하는데 왜 바꾸지 않나요?","source_cn":"你们不喜欢他，为什么不换掉他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6B363F7A399222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1521020029:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">헤라니 님</style>의 유일한 아이니까 그렇지!","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1521020029":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">헤라니 님</style>의 유일한 아이니까 그렇지!","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿下</style>唯一的孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_